abstract: "Cochrane-level systematic review and meta-analysis of ambient AI scribes for clinical documentation. Version 1.0, 22 October 2026: 74 studies included. Documentation time fell by about a fifth on average (relative change -18.9%, k 15; SMD -0.38, k 13, GRADE low); work exhaustion fell in the two randomised trials (SMD -0.44, GRADE moderate); notes with at least one error pooled at 59.8% (k 2, GRADE very low). Preprint DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23565499 (Zenodo)."
